  "question": {
    "text": "<p>When unpolarized light is incident at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo></math> on a transparent medium from air. The reflected ray is completely polarized. The angle of refraction in the medium is</p>",
